{"study_accession":"PRJNA692607","secondary_study_accession":"SRP302036","title":"Human AML1-ETO driven acute myeloid leukemia (AML) shows a dysfunctional immune microenvironment.","description":"AML is a genetically heterogeneous, aggressive hematological malignancy induced by distinct oncogenic driver mutations. Cancer immunosurveillance is a coordinated response from innate and adaptive immune cells against cancer cells. The effect of specific AML oncogenes on immune activation or suppression has not been investigated. Overall design: Bone marrow from AML patients or healhy controls were obtained and Ficoll gradient seperated to extract mononuclear cells. Cells were sorted for immune cell fraction (CD34-CD45+) and subject to 3' single cell RNA sequencing using 10x Genomics platform.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17353547","study_accession":"PRJNA692607","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"Healthy_NY","description":"Healthy_NY","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM5023726","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-06-05","attributes":[["source_name","Immune cell fraction"],["cell_type","CD34-CD45+"],["tissue","bone marrow"],["disease","Healthy"],["genotype","not applicable"],["age","20"],["sex","male"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13448151","experiment_accession":"SRX9861339","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":0,"base_count":0,"first_public":"2024-06-05","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM5023726: Healthy_NY Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17353548","study_accession":"PRJNA692607","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"AML_NY","description":"AML_NY","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM5023725","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-06-05","attributes":[["source_name","Immune cell fraction"],["cell_type","CD34-CD45+"],["tissue","b